 (verdict Reject)
 (notes
  "CLASSIFICATION: REJECT-as-default / KEEP-as-regime-axis (experiment-flag-discipline.md Rule 4: not do-not-revive). WHAT THE DATA SAYS on the clean warehouse (V6 = 0 on all six cells, validator_diff -check V6 exit 0 per salt): level -101 / +91 / -242pp; realised -$683k / +$170k / +$1.06M; maxDD worse / worse / better (37.6->41.0, 32.8->35.0, 43.0->39.6); Sharpe -/+/-. No salt-robust property except the exit mix (~80 fewer stop_loss, ~165 more laggard_rotation per cell) and the same shared trades widening (CLS 2023-06-20, BFX 2020-04-22, BB 2006) - a mechanism without an edge: whipsaws saved are paid back by wider losses on trades that fail anyway (WNC 2003 -$122k every cell) and by 5 force liquidations per map cell vs 2-3 (a wider stop leaves more room for a gap below it). WHY THE _v7mark READ LOOKED LIKE A DRAWDOWN FLOOR (maxDD 42-45 -> 31-38 at every salt, +207/+429/+571pp): the map's smaller tickets let BOTH legs of a rename twin clear the cash gate (NLS/BFX, BB/BBRY, RCII/UPBD; V6 = 5-6 on every map cell vs 2-5 on the record), so a 2020 monster was funded twice and its doubled equity lifted the curve through exactly the COVID drawdown; $0.8-0.9M of each cell's level and the maxDD win were the same artifact, plus $1.4-1.9M of open MTM (VIAV) and the corrupt MEL series (#2732). A maxDD improvement on a warehouse with V6 > 0 is not a read. RECORD BAND RE-BASED on _v10dedup by the null cells: 312 / 383 / 640% (salts 1/0/2), maxDD 32.8-43.0, 707-728 trades; salt 2's 640 is $3.84M unrealised on three open names (ADTN, MU, URI) - quote the band. The _v10dedup null is a new path draw vs _v7mark (first divergence 2005-02-04), not record-minus-twins. WHY KEEP AS AXIS: the per-state read is inert and cheap (a0 = r0 digit-for-digit at three salts on _v7mark), a narrower-than-record map (Deteriorating/Bearish < 1.0) was never tested, and the 09-04 per-state P&L asymmetry remains a real observation. ITEM 4 (per-state width x the 12%-weekly cadence) does NOT proceed - its premise was the floor. FORWARD GUIDANCE: any width lever on the 2000 vintage now pairs against the a0-v10 band above; twin-dedupe + V6 gate + open-MTM decomposition BEFORE any maxDD claim. Artifacts: dev/experiments/stop-width-by-state-2026-09-08/results/*-v10-* (paired per salt), README sections 'Re-run on the deduped warehouse' + 'Three-salt read on _v10dedup'. Related ledger: 2026-08-24-stops-basis-book-faithful (the 4% default this map widens), 2026-08-27-entry-rest-weeks-surface (clock-52: the maxDD-only property precedent)."))
